{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Cross-faction battleground: two Alliance players queue for Warsong Gulch and fight on opposite sides",
  "contract": "Battlegrounds match players regardless of faction. Two Alliance players who queue for Warsong Gulch one after the other enter the same match on opposite sides: the first keeps the Alliance side, the second fights for the Horde and counts as Horde while inside, while keeping their own race and appearance; name queries answer with a Horde race so the client's scoreboard lists them as Horde. Leaving the battleground returns the second player to the Alliance.",
  "timeout_ms": 180000,
